    "bodyHtml": "<div><figure><div><picture><source srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jfg7!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa39173b2-8ec4-4505-8a1f-d7d447fb699f_888x1000.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jfg7!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa39173b2-8ec4-4505-8a1f-d7d447fb699f_888x1000.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jfg7!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa39173b2-8ec4-4505-8a1f-d7d447fb699f_888x1000.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jfg7!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa39173b2-8ec4-4505-8a1f-d7d447fb699f_888x1000.jpeg 1456w\" type=\"image/webp\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jfg7!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa39173b2-8ec4-4505-8a1f-d7d447fb699f_888x1000.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jfg7!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa39173b2-8ec4-4505-8a1f-d7d447fb699f_888x1000.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jfg7!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa39173b2-8ec4-4505-8a1f-d7d447fb699f_888x1000.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jfg7!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa39173b2-8ec4-4505-8a1f-d7d447fb699f_888x1000.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jfg7!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa39173b2-8ec4-4505-8a1f-d7d447fb699f_888x1000.jpeg 1456w\" width=\"888\" height=\"1000\"></picture></div></figure></div><p>Awkward Beauty</p><div><pre>May coincidence tell the tale,\nAll the grinding and halting,\nAnd the going going going,\nAnd as much as this is purple,\nThe world is only blue.</pre></div><p>The idea for this piece and these words were both there when I woke up on the morning of May 6th, 2026. It was a good night’s sleep: a journey not remembered but expressed.</p><p>And being a perfectionist, I didn't want to publish it immediately, my worrying sometimes gets in the way. This post needed to wait for a final review.</p><h5>image: Steve Armstrong, untitled, acrylic on wood, 12”x12”x12”, 2026.</h5>"
