    "bodyHtml": "<div><figure><div><picture><source srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BMby!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F07a61ae4-aea1-473b-b789-5378151b2808_1000x681.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BMby!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F07a61ae4-aea1-473b-b789-5378151b2808_1000x681.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BMby!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F07a61ae4-aea1-473b-b789-5378151b2808_1000x681.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BMby!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F07a61ae4-aea1-473b-b789-5378151b2808_1000x681.jpeg 1456w\" type=\"image/webp\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BMby!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F07a61ae4-aea1-473b-b789-5378151b2808_1000x681.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BMby!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F07a61ae4-aea1-473b-b789-5378151b2808_1000x681.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BMby!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F07a61ae4-aea1-473b-b789-5378151b2808_1000x681.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BMby!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F07a61ae4-aea1-473b-b789-5378151b2808_1000x681.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BMby!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F07a61ae4-aea1-473b-b789-5378151b2808_1000x681.jpeg 1456w\" width=\"1000\" height=\"681\"></picture></div></figure></div><blockquote><p>Thus a spirited and vehement expression by being expanded is weakened. As wild beasts gather their limbs together for an attack, so language also should gather itself, as it were, into a coil to acquire force.</p></blockquote><h5>Demetrius, “On Style”,  in <em>Aristotle's Poetics, Demetrius on Style, Longinus on the Sublime</em>, T. A. Moxon trans., London: J. M. Dent and Sons, 1963, p. 66.</h5><h5>image: Steve Armstrong, <em>untitled</em> (The Moon?), graphite on paper, 2008.</h5>"
